{"id":"conv_04595","context":"A uni student interviews a retired bureaucrat about reforms","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Thank you for your time today. First, I'd like to ask about the reforms at the former MITI.","jp":"本日はお時間をいただきありがとうございます。まず、旧通産省での改革について伺いたいのですが。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,5,6,7,14,17,39,56,62,75,94,111,370,492,745,944,1429,1680,5401,5804,6963,9154,10363,11758],"jpTokens":[{"s":"本日","r":"ほんじつ","w":944},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"時間","r":"じかん","w":111},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"いただき","w":1429},{"s":"ありがとう","w":492},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"},{"s":"まず","w":370},{"s":"、"},{"s":"旧","r":"きゅう","w":1680},{"s":"通産省","r":"つうさんしょう","w":6963},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"改革","r":"かいかく","w":745},{"s":"について","w":75},{"s":"伺い","r":"うかがい","w":11758},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Ah, that brings back memories. Back then labor-management conflicts were fierce, every day felt like a battlefield.","jp":"ああ、懐かしいねえ。当時は労使の対立が激しくて、毎日が戦場のようだったよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,4,6,8,21,27,68,73,555,622,1162,1573,2861,2872,3300,4088,4726,4844,6712,6968,7008,12402,17028],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ああ","w":1162},{"s":"、"},{"s":"懐かしい","r":"なつかしい","w":4726},{"s":"ねえ","w":1573},{"s":"。"},{"s":"当時","r":"とうじ","w":555},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"労使","r":"ろうし","w":6968},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"対立","r":"たいりつ","w":2872},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"激しく","r":"はげしく","w":3300},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"毎日","r":"まいにち","w":622},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"戦場","r":"せんじょう","w":7008},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"よう","w":27},{"s":"だっ","w":21},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"It was an era still shadowed by postwar suppression of speech, right? I heard protesters flooded the streets.","jp":"戦後の言論弾圧の名残もあった時代ですよね。